[32m+[m[32mcardinality requirements for package features and ACTIVE relationship scopes.[m
[32m+[m[32mInspect existing invalid rows on an approved target before validating new[m
[32m+[m[32mconstraints or changing nullability. Do not silently backfill active consent or[m
[32m+[m[32medit committed historical SQL. A collision in an earlier backfill can require[m
